happening to said worlds, and I want it to stop. That's where I need you, for your ability to see in 2D... <i><strong>There's no time to explain!!!1</strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIMENSIONAL TRAVEL</h2>Play the game in multiple dimensions <strong>simultaneously</strong>, traveling through them at will!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/fc819f9d60ceefb8b26b8785cfe11005.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" width=600 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/fc819f9d60ceefb8b26b8785cfe11005.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOT JUST DECORATIONS</h2>All worlds are <strong>truly</strong> different! One might not let you breathe, while the other will allow you to fly!..<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/2c552635d2537a210118534cc7e4da58.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" width=600 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/2c552635d2537a210118534cc7e4da58.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC LEVELS</h2>Each level <strong>changes</strong> whenever you fail! Say &quot;yes!&quot; to an ever-fresh experience!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/0fe027586814e25dc5fca8d481432460.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" width=600 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/0fe027586814e25dc5fca8d481432460.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREEDOM OF MOVEMENT</h2>Make <strong>your</strong> way! And if it doesn't work, make another one.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/7393edbd6cbcae1821c076eac8a5e8cd.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" width=600 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/7393edbd6cbcae1821c076eac8a5e8cd.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR CHARISMATIC COMPANION</h2>The <strong>best</strong> playable character in the history of gaming <i>(according to herself)</i> will never leave you alone! EVER. <i>(guys, we should rewrite this - it sounds like a threat)</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/ebf60ddf62a81330cb3f0ec1ee64db82.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" width=600 height=169 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/ebf60ddf62a81330cb3f0ec1ee64db82.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Yes, please<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Sure<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Why not<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The number of colored LEDs on the PC is not important.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Totally Normal Creature"],"publishers":["Totally Normal Creature"],"release_date":"16 Jun, 2023"}